{
    desc => q{s at end of line is a no-op},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: `s` at the end of line (past last character) does nothing

Macro: `xt/visual/macros/substitute_at_eol`

**initial.png** (before):
- Line 1: `hello world`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0

Keys: `$`, `s`

**cursor_at_eol.png** (intermediate — cursor moved to end of line):
- Line 1: `hello world` (text unchanged)
- Cursor positioned at end of line

**after_s_at_eol.png** (after):
- Line 1: `hello world` (unchanged — `s` is a no-op at EOL)
- Still in normal mode
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('$');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('cursor_at_eol');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('s');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_s_at_eol');
    },
}
